### Race condition

Imagine:

```text
Balance = ₹1000
```

Two requests simultaneously:

```text
T1 → withdraw 800
T2 → withdraw 700
```

Without proper concurrency control:

```text
Both read ₹1000
Both succeed
```

You have created money that doesn't exist.

That is **exactly the sort of scenario I'd expect in this interview**.

